WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.359 --> 00:00:05.890
The SCP Foundation deals with plenty of different
Groups of Interest - cults, rival agencies,

00:00:05.890 --> 00:00:10.570
criminal organizations, all of which have
some connection to anomalous artifacts and

00:00:10.570 --> 00:00:11.700
creatures.

00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:15.849
But there are some groups of interest who
are actually responsible for the creation

00:00:15.849 --> 00:00:22.960
of anomalies, and few are as weird and intriguing
as the Doctor Wondertainment toy company.

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:27.680
Whether or not Doctor Wondertainment is a
real person or not is the subject of much

00:00:27.680 --> 00:00:32.550
speculation, but whoever they are, the company
that bears their name has produced a multitude

00:00:32.550 --> 00:00:37.320
of dangerous anomalous items that are currently
in Foundation containment.

00:00:37.320 --> 00:00:42.610
Usually these anomalies take the form of highly
dangerous toys, but the company has also released

00:00:42.610 --> 00:00:49.340
a very peculiar set of limited edition creations
- a set of 21 living, breathing, more-or-less

00:00:49.340 --> 00:00:54.489
human beings known collectively as… the
Little Misters.

00:00:54.489 --> 00:00:59.670
All of them are marked by tattoos of their
name and each comes with a card reading - “Wow!

00:00:59.670 --> 00:01:04.699
You've just found yourself your very own Little
Mister, a limited edition collection from

00:01:04.699 --> 00:01:06.270
Dr. Wondertainment!

00:01:06.270 --> 00:01:09.430
Find them all and become Mr. Collector!!”

00:01:09.430 --> 00:01:15.740
Let’s take a look and see what’s out there,
before you try and catch ‘em all.

00:01:15.740 --> 00:01:21.820
SCP-905 – or Mr. Chameleon - is a living
being made up entirely of photons.

00:01:21.820 --> 00:01:26.580
His form is described as “fuzzy, but definite”,
and he appears to be the rough shape of a

00:01:26.580 --> 00:01:31.590
human male standing at approximately 175 centimeters
in height.

00:01:31.590 --> 00:01:37.110
He has no mass due to being made solely of
light particles, at least not one we can measure,

00:01:37.110 --> 00:01:42.600
and while he can move and speak, he cannot
manipulate objects in the world around him.

00:01:42.600 --> 00:01:47.310
Mr. Chameleon, as his name suggests, can alter
the wavelength of the light coming from his

00:01:47.310 --> 00:01:50.180
body in order to match the color of his environment.

00:01:50.180 --> 00:01:55.159
He also has the ability to walk through any
transparent material.

00:01:55.159 --> 00:02:01.160
SCP-2287 – or Mr. Headless – is a human
male who is mostly normal aside from his lack

00:02:01.160 --> 00:02:02.370
of a head.

00:02:02.370 --> 00:02:09.149
Mr. Headless is blind, but can somehow still
speak and hear, and does not need to eat.

00:02:09.149 --> 00:02:13.370
Spending time around Mr. Headless can cause
people to experience dissociative episodes

00:02:13.370 --> 00:02:16.700
where they begin to see themselves as headless
as well.

00:02:16.700 --> 00:02:22.560
In an interview, Mr. Headless claims to have
been created for use as a Halloween decoration,

00:02:22.560 --> 00:02:27.720
with his dissociative effect on others being
intended as a kind of spooky prank, even if

00:02:27.720 --> 00:02:30.980
it does sound more like a form of torture.

00:02:30.980 --> 00:02:35.890
Mr. Headless was found by the Foundation wandering
the streets of a Wisconsin town after he left

00:02:35.890 --> 00:02:40.400
an attic where he had been kept with other
holiday decorations.

00:02:40.400 --> 00:02:48.040
SCP-1799 – or Mr. Laugh – is a human male
standing 120 cm tall, who has the physical

00:02:48.040 --> 00:02:53.880
characteristics of a classic circus clown
complete with grey and white skin, a red nose,

00:02:53.880 --> 00:02:55.400
and comically long feet.

00:02:55.400 --> 00:03:01.090
He is capable of communication, but everything
he says will be interpreted by those around

00:03:01.090 --> 00:03:02.470
him as a joke.

00:03:02.470 --> 00:03:06.560
No matter what he says, people around him
will start to laugh.

00:03:06.560 --> 00:03:09.819
And the more he talks, the more people laugh.

00:03:09.819 --> 00:03:16.060
In some cases, they can even laugh themselves
to death - for example, one D-class personnel

00:03:16.060 --> 00:03:20.720
used to test the effects of Mr. Laugh started
laughing so hard that he lost his balance

00:03:20.720 --> 00:03:23.769
and suffered a fatal cranial injury.

00:03:23.769 --> 00:03:29.170
SCP-909 – or Mr. Forgetful – is a man
with apparent retrograde amnesia.

00:03:29.170 --> 00:03:34.280
He appears aware of his condition and cannot
seem to recall any of his own memories.

00:03:34.280 --> 00:03:39.099
The only way that information appears able
to enter Mr. Forgetful's long term memory

00:03:39.099 --> 00:03:40.350
is if he writes it down.

00:03:40.350 --> 00:03:46.040
However, whenever he does so, something strange
happens - the memory he's just written down

00:03:46.040 --> 00:03:51.290
is instantly forgotten by anyone else who
was involved in the events.

00:03:51.290 --> 00:03:57.930
SCP-3537 - or Mr. Shapey – is an amorphous
humanoid that changes shape, though this transformation

00:03:57.930 --> 00:04:00.040
happens involuntarily.

00:04:00.040 --> 00:04:04.980
All of Mr. Shapey's transformations are into
non-anomalous human beings, and they have

00:04:04.980 --> 00:04:10.480
been seen taking their own notes on possible
anomalous properties each new persona could

00:04:10.480 --> 00:04:11.480
have.

00:04:11.480 --> 00:04:16.109
They describe these transformations as painful,
with the level of pain varying dependent on

00:04:16.109 --> 00:04:18.840
how dramatic the change is.

00:04:18.840 --> 00:04:22.889
Despite the pain, Mr. Shapey says they're
happy the way they are.

00:04:22.889 --> 00:04:28.270
In an interview, they claimed to be the first
of the Little Misters, and their random transformations

00:04:28.270 --> 00:04:35.090
were used as inspiration for the appearances
of all of the subsequent Little Mister designs.

00:04:35.090 --> 00:04:41.240
SCP-1908 – or Mr. Soap – is a man who
constantly produces soapy water, which will

00:04:41.240 --> 00:04:46.610
quickly fill up any area he's in and cause
all surrounding surfaces to become slippery.

00:04:46.610 --> 00:04:50.999
The soap can be easily cleaned up with normal
methods, but the levels of the liquid being

00:04:50.999 --> 00:04:54.509
produced by Mr. Soap's body have to be constantly
monitored.

00:04:54.509 --> 00:04:59.199
When the Foundation discovered him, he was
in a factory in China where he had been put

00:04:59.199 --> 00:05:01.860
to work cleaning the machinery.

00:05:01.860 --> 00:05:07.789
SCP-913 – or Mr. Hungry – is a middle-aged,
African American male wearing a dress shirt

00:05:07.789 --> 00:05:12.210
and pants, who is capable of eating almost
any material.

00:05:12.210 --> 00:05:17.080
Mr. Hungry is given nutrients intravenously,
and must be provided with a full day's worth

00:05:17.080 --> 00:05:22.219
of calories every two hours, or else he will
enter a hunger trance.

00:05:22.219 --> 00:05:28.050
While in this trance state, he is capable
of biting with a force of up to 5,000 newtons

00:05:28.050 --> 00:05:30.900
and will devour anything and everything around
him.

00:05:30.900 --> 00:05:36.470
His metabolism is so fast that drugs and toxins
have no effect on him, including amnestics

00:05:36.470 --> 00:05:38.300
and anesthesia.

00:05:38.300 --> 00:05:45.659
SCP-629 – or Mr. Brass – is a massive
brass automaton, standing at 170 cm and weighing

00:05:45.659 --> 00:05:47.619
500 kilograms.

00:05:47.619 --> 00:05:52.949
All parts of Mr. Brass' body are removable
and can be rearranged with only mild discomfort

00:05:52.949 --> 00:05:54.889
to Mr. Brass himself.

00:05:54.889 --> 00:05:59.879
Projections show that there are at least 73
billion possible combinations of Mr. Brass'

00:05:59.879 --> 00:06:00.960
body parts.

00:06:00.960 --> 00:06:05.111
When Mr. Brass was discovered by the Foundation,
he had been taken in by the Church of the

00:06:05.111 --> 00:06:11.249
Broken God, who believed him to be a religious
idol and worshipped him as a deity.

00:06:11.249 --> 00:06:16.539
SCP-644 – or Mr. Hot – is a man who can
both accurately guess the number of children

00:06:16.539 --> 00:06:23.169
that any person has, biological or otherwise,
and predict the material wishes of any child.

00:06:23.169 --> 00:06:28.819
He also claims to be able to accurately predict
the popularity of any product aimed at children.

00:06:28.819 --> 00:06:33.349
When approached, he will offer a business
card that identifies him as Dr. Wondertainment's

00:06:33.349 --> 00:06:34.849
marketing consultant.

00:06:34.849 --> 00:06:39.319
He was found sleeping in the hallway of a
school in Racine, Wisconsin, a town that was

00:06:39.319 --> 00:06:45.130
later found to contain many children with
anomalous Wondertainment toys in their possession.

00:06:45.130 --> 00:06:49.849
In interviews, Mr. Hot describes his job as
being able to identify which children would

00:06:49.849 --> 00:06:52.740
get the most use out of a Wondertainment toy.

00:06:52.740 --> 00:06:57.929
In his own words - “You can't just give
this kind of craftsmanship to just anybody.

00:06:57.929 --> 00:07:02.069
You give the average kid a realistic racecar,
he's just gonna leave it on the shelf and

00:07:02.069 --> 00:07:05.319
go stare at the sun or something.”

00:07:05.319 --> 00:07:12.740
SCP-2396 – or Ms. Sweetie – is a female
humanoid who stands at 250 cm tall and weighs

00:07:12.740 --> 00:07:14.559
101 kg.

00:07:14.559 --> 00:07:20.159
She lives entirely on sugar and foods containing
sugar, and claims to be in pain when denied

00:07:20.159 --> 00:07:21.909
her sweet ”fuel.”

00:07:21.909 --> 00:07:27.030
She has a repellent effect on males, a feature
which she says is meant to “keep nasty brothers

00:07:27.030 --> 00:07:29.060
and their friends out”.

00:07:29.060 --> 00:07:33.839
Anomalous hard candies will appear at random,
anywhere in a 6 km radius of Ms. Sweetie's

00:07:33.839 --> 00:07:34.999
location.

00:07:34.999 --> 00:07:39.929
When ingested by females, the candies are
perfectly harmless, but any masculine-presenting

00:07:39.929 --> 00:07:46.619
humans who eat them start to undergo transformation
into a being made entirely of living candy.

00:07:46.619 --> 00:07:50.929
These candy entities are resistant to blunt
force trauma, but can be easily dispatched

00:07:50.929 --> 00:07:57.469
with fire and will obey any command given
to them by any person who identifies as female.

00:07:57.469 --> 00:08:03.339
SCP-1007 – or Mr. Life – is a male humanoid
who goes through the entire human life cycle

00:08:03.339 --> 00:08:08.179
every 75 minutes, ageing at a rate of one
year per minute.

00:08:08.179 --> 00:08:12.990
Mr. Life has a keyhole in his back that when
a key is inserted into it, can reverse the

00:08:12.990 --> 00:08:14.659
ageing process.

00:08:14.659 --> 00:08:19.279
Each turn of the key regresses Mr. Life one
year younger until he's fully regressed to

00:08:19.279 --> 00:08:21.110
a newborn baby.

00:08:21.110 --> 00:08:25.119
Mr. Life was seized from a California mansion
after he had been purchased at an auction

00:08:25.119 --> 00:08:30.999
held by Marshall, Carter, and Dark Ltd., another
Group of Interest that provides the wealthiest

00:08:30.999 --> 00:08:35.899
and most powerful people in the world with
objects and experiences that would otherwise

00:08:35.899 --> 00:08:40.240
be impossible without the help of the anomalies
they trade in.

00:08:40.240 --> 00:08:44.560
Other Little Misters were also sold at the
auction, though the buyer of Mr. Life couldn't

00:08:44.560 --> 00:08:48.899
recall who they were or exactly which Little
Misters they had bought.

00:08:48.899 --> 00:08:54.360
The tattoo on Mr. Life's back reads “Mr.
Life and Mr. Death”, which may imply that

00:08:54.360 --> 00:09:00.129
Mr. Life has a counterpart that the foundation
has not yet been able to identify.

00:09:00.129 --> 00:09:06.640
SCP-527 – or Mr. Fish – is a non-anomalous
man with no physical abnormalities of any

00:09:06.640 --> 00:09:10.940
kind, save for the fact that he has the head
of a fish.

00:09:10.940 --> 00:09:16.560
He was discovered in Boston in 2002 and moved
to Site 19 in 2004.

00:09:16.560 --> 00:09:22.000
In his initial interview with Fondation researcher
Dr. Baker, Mr. Fish was very frank and up-front

00:09:22.000 --> 00:09:27.100
about his lack of interesting qualities - “Like
I told the other guy, this is all it is.

00:09:27.100 --> 00:09:28.339
You're looking at it.

00:09:28.339 --> 00:09:31.339
Lie, Stripes, Hot, Sweetie, they got all the
good stuff.

00:09:31.339 --> 00:09:33.940
I'm just the guy with a fish head.”

00:09:33.940 --> 00:09:39.149
SCP-917 – or Mr. Moon – is an elderly
man whose facial features wax and wane in

00:09:39.149 --> 00:09:41.230
time with the lunar cycle.

00:09:41.230 --> 00:09:45.720
On nights when the moon is full, his face
is normal, and his face is completely blank

00:09:45.720 --> 00:09:47.720
on nights of a new moon.

00:09:47.720 --> 00:09:52.930
This is painless for Mr. Moon, but he does
lose his sense of sight, hearing, and smell

00:09:52.930 --> 00:09:58.300
when his face is in its new moon state, and
he claims that the experience leaves him very

00:09:58.300 --> 00:09:59.820
tired.

00:09:59.820 --> 00:10:06.089
SCP-2855 – or Mr. Money – is a Latin American
man who is anomalously affected by any business

00:10:06.089 --> 00:10:08.690
transactions regarding his ownership.

00:10:08.690 --> 00:10:13.550
As soon as any person exchanges money for
ownership of Mr. Money, and creates any kind

00:10:13.550 --> 00:10:18.990
of written proof of that ownership, Mr. Money
will be teleported to their location.

00:10:18.990 --> 00:10:23.020
Mr. Money's abilities are also subject to
the beliefs of whoever claims ownership of

00:10:23.020 --> 00:10:28.310
him, and will display any anomalous properties
that are written as part of his contract.

00:10:28.310 --> 00:10:33.400
Mr. Money was recovered in 2007, taken from
the holdings of Marshall, Carter and Dark,

00:10:33.400 --> 00:10:38.050
LLP, a branch of the same company that had
previously sold Mr. Life.

00:10:38.050 --> 00:10:43.120
When Mr. Money was discovered, MC&amp;D had been
selling and buying him back repeatedly in

00:10:43.120 --> 00:10:46.339
order to test his adaptive capabilities.

00:10:46.339 --> 00:10:52.190
SCP-920 – or Mr. Lost – is an Asian man
in a green hoodie who seems to do nothing

00:10:52.190 --> 00:10:54.480
but wander aimlessly.

00:10:54.480 --> 00:10:59.380
Transportation and containment of Mr. Lost
are impossible, as any attempts to do so can

00:10:59.380 --> 00:11:04.019
result in a variety of natural disasters and
other destructive phenomena.

00:11:04.019 --> 00:11:09.389
He has a kind of psychic pull on those around
him, who feel compelled to walk and talk with

00:11:09.389 --> 00:11:10.389
him.

00:11:10.389 --> 00:11:15.120
Mr. Lost doesn't seem to suffer from any environmental
effects, as he has been spotted wandering

00:11:15.120 --> 00:11:20.779
deserts and tundra with no apparent harm coming
to him whatsoever.

00:11:20.779 --> 00:11:27.089
SCP-2284 – or Mr. Lie – is a man of Indian
descent whose voice has a cognitohazardous

00:11:27.089 --> 00:11:29.600
effect on anyone who hears it.

00:11:29.600 --> 00:11:34.649
Any statement that Mr. Lie says will be perceived
as true, despite the fact that Mr. Lie is

00:11:34.649 --> 00:11:37.649
physically incapable of telling the truth.

00:11:37.649 --> 00:11:42.470
Because of this, Mr. Lie communicates mainly
via rhetorical questions, which is the only

00:11:42.470 --> 00:11:47.170
way he can express what he means.

00:11:47.170 --> 00:11:52.050
SCP-2428-1 – or Mr. Mad – is a man in
a multicolored straightjacket who can only

00:11:52.050 --> 00:11:59.209
be seen by those possessing the document designated
SCP-2428, a document which serves as proof

00:11:59.209 --> 00:12:00.709
of purchase.

00:12:00.709 --> 00:12:05.970
Mr. Mad is essentially an imaginary friend,
who can only be seen by the lone person in

00:12:05.970 --> 00:12:09.370
possession of the SCP-2428 document.

00:12:09.370 --> 00:12:14.800
In interviews, Mr. Mad expresses a belief
that he was a real person once, before being

00:12:14.800 --> 00:12:18.079
rendered imaginary by Dr. Wondertainment.

00:12:18.079 --> 00:12:23.779
In fact, there is evidence to suggest many
of the Little Misters were once ordinary people.

00:12:23.779 --> 00:12:30.029
SCP-2933 is a partially submerged steel structure
located in a saltwater reservoir, a structure

00:12:30.029 --> 00:12:36.399
which contains SCP-2933-A – or Mr. Scary.

00:12:36.399 --> 00:12:43.079
The interior of SCP-2933 is constantly changing,
and seems to move and shift in a way that

00:12:43.079 --> 00:12:46.689
directs anyone who enters towards Mr. Scary.

00:12:46.689 --> 00:12:50.839
Once inside the structure, there is no way
back to the entrance.

00:12:50.839 --> 00:12:55.240
Despite his name, and despite the sense of
dread surrounding the steel structure, Mr.

00:12:55.240 --> 00:12:58.430
Scary doesn't seem interested in scaring people.

00:12:58.430 --> 00:13:04.600
He self-identifies as Mr. Smiles, and seems
to have the personality of a young child.

00:13:04.600 --> 00:13:10.400
His body is, like his containment, covered
in rust, a condition which he claims was transferred

00:13:10.400 --> 00:13:13.920
to him by his father and which he says is
very painful.

00:13:13.920 --> 00:13:19.470
While he does have a tattoo naming him Mr.
Smiles, a rusted patch of his skin appears

00:13:19.470 --> 00:13:24.879
to have been marked with “Mr. Scary, property
of The Factory”, suggesting that they may

00:13:24.879 --> 00:13:28.709
have had something to do with his rusted condition.

00:13:28.709 --> 00:13:33.430
SCP-2148 – or Mr. Stripes – is a man wearing
a white blindfold.

00:13:33.430 --> 00:13:38.070
If the blindfold is removed, anything that
Mr. Stripes tries to commit to memory - whether

00:13:38.070 --> 00:13:43.769
that's a passage of text, a scene from a movie,
or a person's face - becomes censored by large

00:13:43.769 --> 00:13:47.050
black bars in all existing records.

00:13:47.050 --> 00:13:52.459
Mr. Stripes refers to Mr. Lie as his brother,
and believes himself to be the first Little

00:13:52.459 --> 00:13:57.540
Mister, although he was told that by Mr. Lie,
so take it with a grain of salt.

00:13:57.540 --> 00:14:02.860
Based on Mr. Stripes' testimony, Mr. Lie spent
a lot of time with him, traveling around and

00:14:02.860 --> 00:14:07.889
making use of their combined abilities to
break into secure government buildings.

00:14:07.889 --> 00:14:12.839
Even though they were close, Mr. Stripes has
never directly looked at Mr. Lie.

00:14:12.839 --> 00:14:17.949
As he tells it, Dr. Wondertainment told him
that he wasn't supposed to look at Mr. Lie

00:14:17.949 --> 00:14:18.949
yet.

00:14:18.949 --> 00:14:23.720
And then last but not least, is Mr. Redd,
who has not been given a designation, and

00:14:23.720 --> 00:14:26.910
is listed as a ”discontinued” Little Mister.

00:14:26.910 --> 00:14:31.800
His story is a topic that would take an entire
video to explain altogether, but he may just

00:14:31.800 --> 00:14:37.429
be the most violent, powerful, and dangerous
of all the Little Misters.

00:14:37.429 --> 00:14:42.019
As interesting as the Little Misters are,
they're not the only anomalous creations of

00:14:42.019 --> 00:14:44.190
the mysterious Dr. Wondertainment.

00:14:44.190 --> 00:14:49.089
So, let us know in the comments if you'd like
to hear more about this twisted toymaker.

00:14:49.089 --> 00:14:53.779
After all, nothing makes you feel more like
a child at heart than running in terror from

00:14:53.779 --> 00:14:56.660
a Dr. Wondertainment original.

00:14:56.660 --> 00:15:02.819
Now check out “SCP-3082 - Neverland’s
Lost Boys and Girls” and “SCP-3008 - Trapped

00:15:02.819 --> 00:15:07.309
In Ikea” for more strangeness from the world
of the SCP Foundation!

